        <div
          class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-surface-container-lowest flex items-center justify-center text-primary-container shadow-sm"
        >
          <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-2xl">support_agent</span>
        </div>
        <h3 class="font-title-lg text-title-lg text-on-surface"
          >Reliable Support</h3
        >
        <p class="font-body-md text-body-md text-secondary leading-relaxed">
          [REPLACE: 24/7 responsive maintenance and technical assistance]
